  "body": "Originally built as a Fletcher show home, this is a home that gets the balance right, quality, comfort, and easy everyday living in one well-executed package.\r\n\r\nBeautifully presented and thoughtfully laid out, the home offers the kind of modern living buyers are actively looking for. Clean lines, well-considered finishes, and a practical floorplan all come together to create a property that feels sharp, functional, and easy to enjoy from the moment you walk in.\r\n\r\nOne of the real standouts here is the sense of space. The bedrooms are genuinely generous in size, which gives the home a level of liveability that can be hard to find. Whether you need room for family, guests, working from home, or simply want a home that does not feel tight or compromised, this one delivers.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is a strong central feature, supported by a scullery and open-plan living that flows well for both day-to-day life and entertaining. Multiple living areas add flexibility, while the covered outdoor space creates an easy connection between inside and out.\r\n\r\nPositioned on an easy-care site, this is a home designed for people who want modern comfort without taking on unnecessary maintenance. It is tidy, well-finished, and ready to be enjoyed.\r\n\r\nThe location only adds to the appeal. With the beach within walking distance and shops, cafés, and local amenities close by, this is a property that offers genuine lifestyle convenience as well as quality living.\r\n\r\nFeatures include:\r\n* Fletcher show home pedigree\r\n* Five bedrooms\r\n* Three bathrooms\r\n* Double garaging\r\n* Generous bedroom sizes\r\n* Modern kitchen with scullery\r\n* Multiple living spaces\r\n* Covered outdoor entertaining area\r\n* Low maintenance section\r\n* Walk to the beach\r\n* Close to shops, cafés, and local amenities\r\n\r\nFor buyers wanting a modern home with quality finishes, real space, and a location that simply makes sense, this is one that deserves your attention.\r\n\r\n61 Red Beach Road, Red Beach\r\nhttp://rwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG32583",
